//RS // comparator permits only those named rewrites plus formatter-added arm blocks,
//RS // bare-lambda parens, leading-dot variant patterns, struct shorthand
//RS // labels/separators, and a required default alias on a dotted module import.
//RS // No rule can reorder or discard an expression operand, operator, marker
//RS // payload, comment, or string interpolation.
